            {
                "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                "word": "anspect",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "48899e34-11ee-4cac-8046-efa2ffef2a86",
                        "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "anspects"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b5e22b2-f81e-3a1c-9540-2efec14116bc",
                        "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Grand levier en bois de chêne employé à la manœuvre des pièces d'artillerie ou les objets de grand poids."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ca52eb3-47a6-46e1-a986-52802a52a504",
                                "sense_id": "5b5e22b2-f81e-3a1c-9540-2efec14116bc",
                                "text": "On ne parvenait à le refouler à poste qu’à force de rudes coups d’anspect, ou à l’aide de puissants apparaux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7d770d3-d753-4e91-a314-8fe6960cfefa",
                                "sense_id": "5b5e22b2-f81e-3a1c-9540-2efec14116bc",
                                "text": "Soudain, une succession de coups frappés au-dessus de leurs têtes avec un anspect résonna comme une petite canonnade dans tout le gaillard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "374e5bee-2d00-411f-8849-1457bc63d2fd",
                                "sense_id": "5b5e22b2-f81e-3a1c-9540-2efec14116bc",
                                "text": "Il avait, à prix d’or, obtenu du concierge le droit de le remplacer, et, pour rendre ce remplacement possible, brisé la jambe gauche dudit concierge, au moyen d’un anspect de rechange."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9289cc4-4060-3e73-9bc9-d1b537a964ec",
                        "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit particulièrement :"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1417bba7-0f83-357a-b71e-b3115f31badc",
                        "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit particulièrement :",
                            "du levier de ce genre qui sert à la manœuvre des canons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "72c52164-f44a-367d-a7ea-ea7f48ec9179",
                        "entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit particulièrement :",
                            "des barres amovibles servant à faire tourner le cabestan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0cfbd861-0061-448e-9ffb-d3dc2a65546b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Handspake",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c513b976-986e-4e1e-8cd2-b8a34dc510e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Handspeiche",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3179e770-ecd6-487f-ad3e-42adac7d158e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "handspike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "handspike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bc660cf-0951-39b2-a07e-72cba73d44dd",
                                        "entry_id": "21a176ac-08c8-31c1-8ba0-c69f4cb34e70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bar or lever, generally of wood, used in a windlass or capstan, for heaving anchor, and, in modified forms, for various purposes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9331667b-9f53-4139-b1d4-5f5826a7a1bb",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc660cf-0951-39b2-a07e-72cba73d44dd",
                                                "text": "I would not take a rood of land from Frederic to be appointed to a man-of-war to-morrow morning, for I looked on it as his (God grant it may be long ere he touch it!) ever since I was the height of a handspike."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0de06306-2319-4182-a1c0-daa782f82624",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc660cf-0951-39b2-a07e-72cba73d44dd",
                                                "text": "“Man the capstan! Blood and thunder!—jump!”—was the next command, and the crew sprang for the handspikes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e31c960a-aa50-4536-98c1-76f90feb1f9c",
                                                "sense_id": "3bc660cf-0951-39b2-a07e-72cba73d44dd",
                                                "text": "Then he rapped on the door with a bit of stick like a handspike that he carried..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "52a2895d-43d1-4d25-b8c8-c0ae2b49473d",
                        "source_entry_id": "5dd54318-f589-3cfc-9ee7-b5a5e5608e0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "hand-spike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hand-spike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b2a539d-0448-368b-93fc-ba68aae2d5c5",
                                        "entry_id": "c8eb23e0-77a4-3c73-80e5-c7f0a68b5012",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of handspike."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9284e682-db95-44dd-8e4e-d3b1f0150eaf",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2a539d-0448-368b-93fc-ba68aae2d5c5",
                                                "text": "This person used a single hand-spike, holding up the upper end and sallying back. When the log rolled back it caused the hand-spike to spring forward, and, before he had time to relinquish his grasp, it flung him head-long forward, like an arrow from the hunter's bow, down the embankment into the water; when recovered, he was dead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de72af28-06ee-47ef-9867-56bf78720327",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2a539d-0448-368b-93fc-ba68aae2d5c5",
                                                "text": "To be sure, we soon found that we were out and wide in our calculations, so when brought to our bearings we began to take kindly to the lay of our watches in scrubbing and wooding, as there was no hand-spike snubbing or squeak of hard words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "282d6aad-7581-45c0-9723-73a5fa9c383e",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2a539d-0448-368b-93fc-ba68aae2d5c5",
                                                "text": "74. To unfold the hand-spike.\nGrasp the hand-spike pivot handle with the left hand and disengage the spring knob from its seat and rotate the handle. Then grasp the hand-spike with the right hand and unfold it engaging the hook. Then rotate the pivot handle to its initial position, engaging the catch in its recess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
